    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>更多一二代组合的发展现状请收听 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a02158b1b7bd50295f3d552" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a02158b1b7bd50295f3d552"><strong><span>Kpop梦醒时分：盘点偶像人生的下半场（上）</span></strong></a></p><p><span>木子在追星时常常会思考，</span><strong><span>我现在所喜欢的偶像在未来会变成什么样子。</span></strong><span>我喜欢的她们那些魅力，团魂，cp会一直存在吗？也会像其她爱豆一样红得发紫又或者塌房，解散，结婚吗？</span><strong><span>偶像这份职业在闪闪发光的当下成为过去式之后，究竟承诺了一种怎么样的人生？</span></strong></p><p><span>所以本期节目我们开始向前考证，那些出道更早，已经步入了人生下一个阶段的偶像曾经经历过怎样的时光，如今又在过什么样的生活。</span><strong><span>我们整理了KPOP一二三四代部分偶像的经历与现状，通过这些前人走过的道路，为我们和她们寻找更多的可能性。</span></strong></p><p><em><span>本期节目涉及的信息量比较大，部分古早信息存在一定探究难度，主播们的追星阅历也实在有限，所以难免会存在一些信息的错误与遗漏。</span></em></p><p><strong><span>任何需要修正和补充的内容，都欢迎大家在评论区与我们分享。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>二代男团 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">00:02:13</a></span></p><p><span>Bigbang</span></p><p><span>FTIsland</span></p><p><span>超新星</span></p><p><span> Shinee</span></p><p><span>2AM</span></p><p><span>2PM</span></p><p><span>Beast</span></p><p><span>U-kiss</span></p><p><span>帝国之子</span></p><p><strong><span>二代女团 </span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">00:27:53</a> </span></p><p><span>4minute</span></p><p><span>Brown Eyed Girls</span></p><p><span>Afterschool</span></p><p><span>Secret</span></p><p><span>Rainbow</span></p><p><strong><span>三代女团 </span></strong><span>  <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a> </span></p><p><span>MissA</span></p><p><span>AOA</span></p><p><span>Brave Girls</span></p><p><span>Stellar</span></p><p><span>Apink</span></p><p><span>Crayon pop</span></p><p><span>Lady’s code</span></p><p><strong><span>三代男团 </span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a> </span></p><p><span>Boyfriend</span></p><p><span>Nuest</span></p><p><span>EXO</span></p><p><span>BTS</span></p><p><strong><span>四代男团 </span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4720">01:18:40</a> </span></p><p><span>Winner</span></p><p><span>UNIQ</span></p><p><span>Hotshot</span></p><p><span>A.C.E</span></p><p><span>ikon</span></p><p><span>NCT</span></p><p><strong><span>四代女团 </span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5935">01:38:55</a> </span></p><p><span>Twice</span></p><p><span>BLACKPINK</span></p><p><span>Laboum</span></p><p><span>Lovelyz</span></p><p><span>April</span></p><p><span>Gugudan</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><p><span>青春（Day）- OOHYO</span></p><p><span>我们的明天 - 鹿晗</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
